{"sourceUrl":"https://cl.fzu.edu.cn/info/1072/18873.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:42.758945+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://cl.fzu.edu.cn/info/1072/18873.htm","html":"<div>\n\n\n<div>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>根据我校《福州大学</span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年推荐免试研究生（含硕士生和直博生）招生简章》文件精神</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>结合我院实际，特制定本复试方案。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、接收免试生的条件和范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>1.<span>申请条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>遵纪守法，品德良好，积极向上，身心健康；获得所在高校</span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年推免生资格的应届本科毕业生。申请直博的推免生须有材料、化学、化工相关专业背景。</span></span><strong><span><span>我校不接收</span><span>“</span><span>退役大学生士兵计划</span><span>”</span><span>专项的推免生</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>2. <span>招收推免生的专业与计划数</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>接收直博生专业为：材料物理与化学、材料学、材料加工工程、资源利用科学与工程。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>接收硕士生专业为：材料化学、材料科学与工程、材料工程。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>我院计划总接收硕士生人数为</span></span><span><span>32</span></span><span><span>名</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>直博生</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>名。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、申请程序</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1. <span>符合条件且有意申请到我院的推免生（含直博生），在教育部</span><span>“</span><span>推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>（网址</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span>http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm<span>）开通前，</span></span><span><span>务必</span></span><strong><span><span>在</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>1</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span><span>1</span></span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong><strong><span><span>:0</span></span></strong><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span><span>前</span></span></strong><span><span>通过我校</span><span>“</span></span><a href=\"http://219.229.132.120/login.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>推免生预报名系统</span></span></a><span><span>”</span><span>进行预报名</span></span><span><span>，并将</span></span><strong><span><span>本人手写签名</span></span></strong><span><span>后</span></span><span><span>《</span></span><span><span>福州大学推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生复试申请表》扫描件（</span></span><span><span>见附件</span>1</span><span><span>），</span></span><span><span>命名为</span><span>“姓名+报考专业+申请类别”</span></span><span><span>发送至</span><span>cailiaozhaokao@</span></span><span>163.</span><span><span>com</span><span>。</span></span><span><span>教育部</span><span>“</span><span>推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>开通后，考生务必</span></span><span><span>按</span></span><span><span>规定时间</span></span><span><span>在此系统</span></span><span><span>完成正式报名。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span>. <span>我院统一采用</span></span><strong><span><span>线下</span></span></strong><span><span>面试方式。</span></span><span><span>复试名单</span></span><strong><span><span>预计在</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>1</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><span><span>将</span></span><span><span>公布于福州大学材料科学与工程学院官网（网址：</span></span><span>https://cl.fzu.edu.cn/index.htm</span><span><span>）通知文件模块。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、资格审查及相关材料</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>请考生持有效证件及相关材料（详见以下清单要求）于</span></span><strong><span>2025</span></strong><strong><span><span>年</span></span></strong><strong><span>9</span></strong><strong><span><span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>19</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span><span>9:00</span></span></strong><strong><span>-9</span></strong><strong><span><span>:</span></span></strong><strong><span>3</span></strong><strong><span><span>0</span></span></strong><span><span>到</span></span><strong><span><span>嘉锡楼</span><span>31</span></span></strong><strong><span>5</span></strong><span><span>室报到并进行资格审查。经审查，若发现有不符合报考条件或替考的考生，取消其复试资格。资格审查材料清单如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）二代身份证及学生证的原件和复印件（身份证复印正反面，学生证复印学生信息和注册情况）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）</span></span><span><span>福州大学推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生复试申请表，</span></span><span><span>可在福大预报名系统提交后打印</span></span><span><span>（需</span></span><span><span>本人手写签名</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>，见附件</span>1<span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3）《教育部学籍在线验证报告》，可在学信网下载打印</span></span><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>务必</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>保证验证报告</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>/</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>备案表</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>的</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>二维码在有效期内</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>，有效期至本年度</span><span>7月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><span><span>；</span></span><strong></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>4<span>）本科正式成绩单</span><span>1</span><span>份（原件，须加盖学校教务部门公章）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>5<span>）有学术科研成果（发表的论文、出版的专著等）和获奖证书者，提供复印件各</span><span>1</span><span>份</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>6<span>）申请直博生须提交至少</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>名所报考学科专业领域内的教授（或相当专业技术职称的专家）的书面推荐意见</span></span><span><span>（需专家手写签字和专家所在单位盖章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>7<span>）</span></span><span><span>福州大学研究生招生复试考生诚信承诺书</span></span><span><span>（需本人手写签</span></span><span><span>名</span></span><span><span>），见附件</span>2</span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>注：</span></span><span><span>以上材料须</span></span><strong><span><span>本人签名</span></span></strong><span><span>确保真实</span></span><span><span>有效。</span></span><span><span>请按照上述顺序对材料进行编号。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>8<span>）思想政治素质和品德考核证明表，见附件</span><span>3</span><span>，需要负责人签字并加盖人事（或政工、或组织）部门公章</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>考生进行思想政治品德考核面谈时，将这些材料交给面谈老师。</span></span></strong><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、思想政治品德考核</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>《思想政治素质和品德考核证明表》须由考生本人档案或工作所在单位的人事、政工部门加盖印章。</span></span><strong><span><span>2025</span><span>年</span></span></strong><strong><span>9</span></strong><strong><span><span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>1</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>9</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><span><span>复试面试结束后当日携带《思想政治素质和品德考核证明表》原件至指定地点进行面谈。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、复试内容与成绩计算</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>复试内容包括英语测试、专业测试（</span>PPT<span>汇报环节）和综合测试（考官提问环节）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>直博生面试时长一般</span></span><strong><span><span>不少于</span></span></strong><span>30<span>分钟，具体时间可由面试专家组根据面试情况适当调整。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）英语测试：请考生准备</span></span><span>3</span><span><span>分钟的英文自我介绍（分值</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span>20</span><span><span>分</span></span><span><span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）专业测试（</span><span>PPT</span><span>汇报）：请考生准备</span></span><span>12</span><span><span>分钟的</span>PPT<span>介绍，汇报内容为：本人学习情况和科研情况（主持或参与项目情况、参加竞赛、发表论文、专利等）</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>以及对未来博士期间的科研规划等（分值</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span>40</span><span><span>分</span></span><span><span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>3<span>）综合测试：考官提问，考生回答，时长约</span></span><span>15</span><span><span>分钟（分值</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span>40</span><span><span>分</span></span><span><span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>硕士生面试时长一般</span></span><strong><span><span>不少于</span></span></strong><span>20<span>分钟，具体时间可由面试专家组根据面试情况适当调整。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）英语测试：请考生准备</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>分钟的英文自我介绍（分值</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span>20</span><span><span>分</span></span><span><span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）专业测试（</span><span>PPT</span><span>汇报）：请考生准备</span></span><span>8</span><span><span>分钟的</span>PPT<span>介绍，汇报内容为：本人学习情况和科研情况（主持或参与项目情况、参加竞赛、发表论文、专利等）</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>以及对未来科研生涯规划等（分值</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span>40</span><span><span>分</span></span><span><span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>3<span>）综合测试：考官提问，考生回答，时长约</span></span><span>10</span><span><span>分钟（分值</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span>40</span><span><span>分</span></span><span><span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>成绩计算</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>规则如下：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）复试总分满分为</span><span>100</span><span>分，其中英语测试</span><span>20</span><span>分，专业测试</span><span>40</span><span>分，综合测试</span><span>40</span><span>分。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）复试全程由各专业复试小组负责考核，复试成绩由每位复试小组成员独立给出分数，去掉最高分和最低分后，取算术平均值得出。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>六</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、录取原则</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>与</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>复试安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>1</span></span></strong><strong><span>.<span>录取原则</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>按复试总成绩分专业从高到低录取，如果考生所在专业推免录取名额已满，征求考生意愿，可以调剂到推免接收名额未满的相关专业录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>我校在</span></span><span><span>“</span><span>全国推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>上</span></span><span><span>向复试合格（复试总成绩</span>&gt;=60<span>分）且通过研究生招生办最终审核者发送待录取通知。取得我校推荐免试研究生接收函的申请者必须在规定的时限内在系统上同意待录取，否则取消拟录取资格；接受我校待录取后一律不予解锁。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>出现以下情况的推免生，我校取消其录取资格：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）入学报到时未取得本科毕业证书。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）体检或政审不合格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）考试作弊或违纪（法）受到“警告”以上处分，或有其它情节严重的违法乱纪行为。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）对在申请过程中弄虚作假的推免生，一经发现，即取消其复试或录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>2</span></span></strong><strong><span>.</span></strong><strong><span><span>复试安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>第一批复试</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><strong><span>9<span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>1</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>9</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日上午</span>10</span></strong><strong><span><span>:</span></span></strong><strong><span>00<span>开始</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>，复试地点：嘉锡楼</span><span>3</span></span></strong><strong><span>13</span></strong><strong><span><span>房间；</span></span></strong><strong><span> </span></strong><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>第二批复试（接收计划还有空额的专业</span></span><span><span>）：</span></span><span>9<span>月</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>日</span>-10<span>月</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>日（待定）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>咨询电话：</span></span><span><span>0</span></span><span>591-22866532<span>梁老师</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>七、体检</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>考生在获得拟录取资格</span><span>2周内按学院要求提交体检报告单。体检不合格者，或无故未在规定时间内提交体检报告者，将取消拟录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span></span><span>. </span><span><span>考生可选择前往福州大学旗山校区校医院体检，注意事项：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1）体检当日可正常进食，即体检当天不必空腹。戴口罩，到现场保持1米距离。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2）参加体检的考生每人自带一张一寸相片和体检费105元（带本人身份证）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3）先到校医院307领表格，并在体检单上标明本人所报考的学院名称。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>在校医院体检结束后，体检无异常的同学学院不再另行通知。</span></span><strong><span><span>校医院的体检单将由校医院直接转交学院，学生不用前往领取。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span>. </span><span><span>考生也可自行前往具有二级甲等资质以上的医院进行体检，</span></span><strong><span><span>建议下载《福州大学学生体检检查表》（见附件</span></span></strong><strong><span>4</span></strong><strong><span><span>）并按表格要求进行操作。</span></span></strong><span><span>（体检报告有效期以复试时间为准，三个月内有效）。体检项目包括：内科、外科、血压、视力、辨色力、听力、肝功能、血常规、尿常规、胸片。体检标准参照教育部、原卫生部、中国残联印发的《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》（教学〔</span><span>2003〕3号）要求，按照《教育部办公厅 卫生部办公厅关于普通高等学校招生学生入学身体检查取消乙肝项目检测有关问题的通知》（教学厅〔2010〕2号）规定执行。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>体检单相关要求</span></span></strong><span><span>：体检单位需对考生整体健康状况作出</span><span>“合格”或“不合格”的结论，并加盖体检单位公章，需体现本人身份证号和照片，包含校方要求的体检项目。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>在获得拟录取资格后</span><span>2周内，考生先将体检单进行扫描，命名为“姓名+录取专业+体检单”，发到cailiaozhaokao@163.com。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3. </span><span><span>收到复查通知电话的同学，请按要求进行体检复查。</span></span><span><span>未在校医院体检的所有体检资料（含复查材料）</span></span><strong><span><span>请本人务必妥善保管，新生报到时上交。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>八、其他注意事项</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）我校</span><span>20</span></span><span><span>26</span></span><span><span>年研究生复试不收取任何复试费用。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）到校指南。福州大学详细地址：</span></span><span><span>福建省福州市福州大学城乌龙江北大道</span>2号</span><span><span>。考生可乘坐飞机、高铁、地铁、公交等多种方式至我校，如乘坐地铁</span><span>2号线至福州大学站，或乘坐41路、48路、55路、95路、96路、168路等多条公交车至我校。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）复试考生入校方式：复试考生请持</span></span><span><span>身份证原件</span></span><span><span>和</span></span><span><span>学院官网上</span></span><strong><span><span>复试考生名单网页截图</span></span></strong><span><span>入校。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（四）</span></span><span><span>其他未尽事宜详见《福州大学</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>招收推荐免试研究生（含硕士生和直博生）招生简章》。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（五）申诉渠道：联系人：张老师，电话：</span><span>0591-</span></span><span>22866541</span><span><span>，地址：福州大学旗山校区嘉锡楼</span><span>3</span></span><span>08</span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>附件</span>1<span>：</span></span><span><span>福州大学推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生复试申请表</span><span>-</span><span>可系统打印</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>附件</span>2<span>：</span></span><span><span>福州大学研究生招生复试考生诚信承诺书</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>附件</span>3<span>：思想政治素质和品德考核证明表</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>附件</span></span><span>4</span><span><span>：福州大学学生体检检查表</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>材料科学与工程学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span> 202</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>日</span> </span></p>\n</div>\n\n</div>","textSha256":"ddc5c6160c4afb9794dd3681526791a8b4701f6bc1119a9919a41a9ca83e2fbc","textLength":3330,"sourceSha256":"7256e87b41c8b5302be430ccea108174bda9d55ffc557b7b7aaa1eb03b5e0b3f","selector":".v_news_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件4_福州大学学生体格检查表.pdf","url":"https://cl.fzu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1747125295&wbfileid=16718092"},{"name":"附件2_福州大学研究生招生复试考生诚信承诺书.docx","url":"https://cl.fzu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1747125295&wbfileid=16718091"},{"name":"附件3-思想政治素质和品德考核证明表.doc","url":"https://cl.fzu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1747125295&wbfileid=16718090"},{"name":"附件1-福州大学推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生复试申请表-可系统打印.doc","url":"https://cl.fzu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1747125295&wbfileid=16718089"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-42725347561f560ce849","title":"2025年福州大学材料科学与工程学院2026年推荐免试研究生（含硕士生和直博生）接收工作复试方案","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:42.758945+00:00"}
